 "stimulus_html": "Determine whether each ordered pair is a solution to the inequality  <span data-math=\"y > x - 1{:}\">y &gt; x - 1{:}</span>",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 508231,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"(0,1)\">(0,1)</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"y > x - 1\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"(0, 1)\"></span></p>\n<p>Is the ordered pair a solution to the inequality?</p>\n<p>Substitute the pair into the inequality.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"1 > 0 - 1\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"1 > -1\"></span></p>\n<p>This is true, so the ordered pair is a solution.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Yes"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
